Band Description: A trio of former projectionists who wear monochromatic wool and leather aprons. They perform seated on crates, operating custom-built pedals that grind scrap metal against the piano’s internal iron frame while they pluck brittle, folk-inspired minor scales on guitars missing their highest strings.

